  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/IMG_4446.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(246 fotos) El barri del Tossalet, a Onda, ha iniciat les festes amb la proclamaci&oacute; de la reina, Andrea Cerezuela Pat&oacute;n, i les seues dames d&#39;honor, Nadia Jim&eacute;nez Iserte i Nerea Garc&iacute;a Mart&iacute;nez, en un acte presentat per Ram&oacute;n Cabedo Esteve. Les festes duraran fins diumenge 27.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestossalet/img_4286.jpg\" alt=\"img_4286\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestossalet/img_4288.jpg\" alt=\"img_4288\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestossalet/img_4289.jpg\" alt=\"img_4289\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestossalet/img_4290.jpg\" alt=\"img_4290\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestossalet/img_4292.jpg\" alt=\"img_4292\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestossalet/img_4293.jpg\" alt=\"img_4293\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestossalet/img_4294.jpg\" alt=\"img_4294\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestossalet/img_4295.jpg\" alt=\"img_4295\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestossalet/img_4296.jpg\" alt=\"img_4296\" style=\"max-w